SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The rraanndd() and ssrraanndd() functions conform to ISO/IEC 9899:1990
     (“ISO C90”).

     The rraanndd__rr() function is not part of ISO/IEC 9899:1990 (“ISO C90”) and is
     marked obsolescent in IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”).  It may be re‐
     moved in a future revision of POSIX.

CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     Prior to FreeBSD 13, rraanndd() used the historical Park-Miller generator
     with 32 bits of state and produced poor quality output, especially in the
     lower bits.  rraanndd() in earlier versions of FreeBSD, as well as other
     standards-conforming implementations, may continue to produce poor qual‐
     ity output.

